graph TD
    %% Entities
    User((User))
    Admin((Admin))
    
    %% Data Stores
    DB[(MongoDB<br/>Incidents & Profiles)]
    
    %% Processes
    P1(1.0<br/>Authentication & RBAC)
    P2(2.0<br/>Input Processing & Modality Extraction)
    P3(3.0<br/>Multilingual & PII Masking)
    P4(4.0<br/>Prediction & Noisy-OR Fusion)
    P5(5.0<br/>Threat & Job Intelligence)
    P6(6.0<br/>Evidence & Safety Planning)
    P7(7.0<br/>Behavioral Intelligence)
    P8(8.0<br/>Chatbot & Summarization)
    
    %% Flows
    User -->|Raw Content / Files| P2
    Admin -->|Credentials| P1
    
    P2 -->|Extracted Text| P3
    P3 -->|Translated & Masked Text| P4
    P3 -->|Extracted IOCs URLs Emails| P5
    
    P4 -->|Raw Risk Scores| P6
    P5 -->|Threat Context| P6
    P5 -->|Threat Context| P4
    
    P6 -->|Final Incident Report| DB
    P6 -->|Safety Plan| User
    
    P6 -->|Incident Context| P7
    P7 -->|Updated Actor Profile| DB
    
    P8 <-->|Read Context| DB
    User <-->|Conversational Query| P8
    
    Admin -->|Dashboard Request| DB
    DB -->|Analytics & Queues| Admin
